            "pdf_page": 7,
            "printed_page": 6
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Get up... get up... All of you fall at my feet and worship me; what am I—a saint? A maharishi? A mahatma?... No! But one thing: you are not bowing at the feet of Zamindar Jambulingam!... You are touching and worshipping the feet of dharma! The feet of justice—the feet of integrity! What do you say, Kalingaraya?... Am I right?..",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
